cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper listed under
  preferred-citation below.
title: "GMCC: Global Mean-Centered Correlation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the Global Mean-Centered Correlation (GMCC),
  a parameter-free, variance-reduced similarity measure that replaces the
  local mean centering of Pearson Correlation with a population-level global
  mean, improving estimator stability and definitional coverage under sparse
  co-observations.
type: software
license: MIT
